[size=4][color=#D0B17A][b]Credits and permissions[/b][/color][/size]
Morphbench: Vhodnoylogin, with development assistance from Codex. PyNifly: BadDogSkyrim and contributors. Python, NumPy and Pillow: their respective developers and contributors. Full dependency credits and licences are included in Runtime as RUNTIME-THIRD-PARTY.md, runtime-dependencies.json and the bundled licence files.

Morphbench is distributed under GNU GPL version 3. Use, modify and redistribute it under that licence, preserving notices and providing the required source. These permissions apply to Morphbench; third-party meshes and game assets retain their own permissions.

Development uses AI-generated code, and this page description was prepared with AI assistance. Public source history and reproducible checks are available in the repository. The cover is AI-generated conceptual artwork; the interface screenshots are actual tool captures. Screenshots show HIMBO's NeverNude male body with boxers and a male CLAW werewolf, with XP32 skeletons. Fur layers and intimate geometry are hidden in the werewolf views for clarity. These model and skeleton assets are illustrations only and are not included in the download.
